        <h3 class="idtl__label">Rooted in the science</h3>
        <p class="idtl__line">
          I wanted the mark to say something about metabolism. Thyroxine, the hormone at the
          centre of metabolic processes, is built from hexagonal rings. That was the simple shape
          I was looking for.
        </p>
        <figure class="idtl__visual idtl__visual--pad idtl__visual--glow">
