    {/* 14. WHERE THIS GOES NEXT */}
    <section class="beat">
      <h2 class="beat__h">Where this goes next</h2>
      <p>
        Phase one was Action: making a single log cost as little as possible. That worked. The
        two stages I set aside at the start, Awareness and Retention, are now the constraint.
      </p>
    </section>

    <ol class="roadmap-list">
      <li class="roadmap-item">
