        <h4 class="roadmap-item__h">1. The app has to tell a story, not list features.</h4>
        <p>
          GoodFlip today is a collection of services a person visits occasionally. Nothing tells
          them what to do today. The IA needs to carry one narrative: log what you eat, see what
          it does to you, act on it. Food logging is the first step in that story, so it has to
          sit where the story starts.
        </p>
