      </li>
      <li class="roadmap-item">
        <span class="roadmap-item__tag">Second front door</span>
        <h4 class="roadmap-item__h">2. Manual logging has to be as good as the AI.</h4>
        <p>
          AI logging is ahead of our competitors. Manual logging is behind them, and it is what
          people fall back on when they know exactly what they ate, when Kaira is slow, or when
          they simply prefer tapping. A fallback people use daily is not a fallback, it is a
          second front door. I have wireframes for this that I am currently pitching to the team.
